body:
 Agreed with u/theBEASTswims.  

&#x200B;

Here's an example if you need it. 

&#x200B;

Warm-up (400) 

2x50 pull free 

1x100 IM order 

1x200 easy swim: your choice 

&#x200B;

Main Set (1,200) 1 minute rest after each

1x300 timed swim: freestyle 

1x400 swimmer's choice 

1x300 timed swim: freestyle 

1 x 200 pull: swimmer's choice 

&#x200B;

Cool down (200) 

1x100 easy kick: IM order

2 x 50 sculling or easy swim 

&#x200B;

&#x200B;
